MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

User decision 散布界 1/2. Reference ISD broadside with normal fire control: 40 km 50.0% -> 85.3%, 20 km 85.3% -> 99.7%,
40 km without fire control 14.8% -> 41.1%.
TODO at PR time: tests/gunnery-accuracy.cjs (5 expectations state the 50% law: 1,3,5,7,8), docs/gunnery-accuracy.md,
profile figures that use the hit chance (data/fleet.js regeneration, FLEET_PROFILE_VERSION), fleet-battle-determinism.

