Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 07:01:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/7] WIP (local, not pushed): balanced / full heat running

heatRunMode, heatRunStep (output factor h.runK toward heat made = 0.97 of rejection capacity; full running ends at 50%
of the store with an event), automatic full running while a ship has a target.
Findings (heatrun.cjs): in gun duels the examples make about 0.74 of their rejection capacity, so neither mode binds.
With rejection cut to 40% the store passes 100% within about a second (base loads alone exceed the capacity and the
store holds about a second of ship heat), so a 1 s controller and a 50% warning cannot act in time. Needs a decision
on the store size / what full running may exceed before this is finished. No tests yet.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GGYoFhz3gjzcFBBt5dzW9N
