From 51269c60a963b0a74e5021724a5fbcfd66798716 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 07:05:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/7] WIP (local, not pushed): point defence only intercepts
 while automatic interception is ON; guns hold fire beyond reach

User decision 2026-11-15. fleetDefense reserves the whole shared point-defence battery while the order is ON (threat
or no threat); OFF, it fires on ships in reach. Piloted turrets: t.pd while ON; a locked target beyond a gun's reach
is not fired on (t.far).
TODO at PR time: tests/dual-purpose-weapons.cjs states the old rule in 9 tests (3,5,6,8,10-14): rewrite with a record.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GGYoFhz3gjzcFBBt5dzW9N
